Third-party software in dbpane

Every crate in the dependency graph of the dbpane binary (normal
dependencies, for the release targets aarch64-apple-darwin,
x86_64-apple-darwin and x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu), with the licence it is
used under, then the licence texts and copyright notices those licences
require. Generated by scripts/gen-third-party.sh from Cargo.lock; do not edit
by hand. dbx's own crates are Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE).

Where a crate offers a choice of licences, the first of MIT, ISC, BSD, Zlib,
Unicode, Apache-2.0 that it offers is the one listed.

